OL,3,AMTV Dirty Sanchez star Michael 'Pancho'
OL,4,ALocke dies aged 47
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to Michael
OL,7,FLocke, star of MTV stunt and prank
OL,8,Fseries Dirty Sanchez, who has died aged
OL,9,F47.
OL,11,FLocke, from Port Talbot, known as
OL,12,F'Pancho', starred in the show and later
OL,13,Fwent on to launch the Welsh clothing
OL,14,Fbrand San Portablo.
OL,16,FHis Dirty Sanchez co-star Mathew
OL,17,FPritchard said Locke "was the best" and
OL,18,Fhe would "never forget him".
